A simple purchase exposes both effective SEK values without recording how they were obtained.

========== API ==========

transactions()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase without annotations
  Assets:Fund  4 FUND
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

2024-01-02 Purchase with recorded lot cost
  Assets:Fund  4 FUND {100 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

